{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id108557854"}, "name":{"label":"themadat"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-10T12:24:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14050120464"}, "title":{"label":"Podcast transcripts: GAME. CHANGER."}, "content":{"label":"The new podcast transcript feature is one on the best feature additions EVER. Essentially it is a “skip ads” feature. No more guess and check 30s forward 15 seconds backward. No more chapter skip just to realize the podcast is putting half the ad in the next chapter. Go to transcript. See … tap next sentence and boom! Love it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id179124635"}, "name":{"label":"michaelxbray"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-09T23:12:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14047869152"}, "title":{"label":"Super Buggy"}, "content":{"label":"There's still a lot to like about Overcast but not even two years into the complete rewrite, it's showing age in both design and functionality. There are little papercuts sprinkled throughout the experience. The app regularly freezes, crashes, jitters on scroll, lags, and eats up battery/storage with no explanation. \n\nAnd while the developer has released a few new features, those updates introduced new bugs while other longtime bugs persist. Users tend to have no acknowledgement or fix on the horizon. Updates are sporadic, and though the dev promised to provide better communication, I haven't seen anything outside of the initial announcement about that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
