{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id251445129"}, "name":{"label":"charcharryu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-02T08:09:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14020418133"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome features but insane battery drain"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast is how Ive listened to my podcasts for years and I love the redesign and the transcripts feature. However, my phone loses so much battery and runs incredibly hot when using this app that I will switch to youtube until this gets addressed in an update", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1148930028"}, "name":{"label":"Chainsaw_Maniac"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-01T14:09:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14017756625"}, "title":{"label":"You have found your podcast app right here!"}, "content":{"label":"I have tried several podcast apps throughout the years, being a cheapo and looking for a free podcast app. This one is the best. I have been using it for probably 4+ years. Yes, it’s a subscription app, but it’s worth every penny if you listen to podcasts frequently, and the price is reasonable for what you get. I get value from this podcast so I am glad to return value to the creators! Do you expect them to work for free? There is a free version but you will want to upgrade to premium. To the creators, thanks for this wonderful creation! A+!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26480511"}, "name":{"label":"nicegiraffe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-30T17:19:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14014509700"}, "title":{"label":"Now drains my battery and cooks my phone"}, "content":{"label":"Since the recent updates, Overcast tanks my battery and makes my phone noticeably hot during basic playback. Neither was an issue before. A long-time favorite that's become hard to use until this is addressed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id11586550"}, "name":{"label":"M. Corey"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-30T05:56:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14012659215"}, "title":{"label":"None better: Stable, easy to use, full featured, cool extras. And now TRANSCRIPTS!"}, "content":{"label":"UPDATE: Still 5 Stars, but now 5 Stars with TRANSCRIPTS! Awesome feature, great implementation, if I could just donate some extra money I probably would. Don’t bother guessing, just go with Overcast.\n\nOrig - The important part of a podcast player is that it plays podcasts. That’s low hanging fruit, and Overcast fulfills that requirement with easy (with great features like a Sleep Timer!). Marco has also built a great podcast browser, with actual sensible recommendations. And he does cool math (look up Fast Fourier Transform) to enable some of the fancier features of the audio engine.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
