{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id31375427"}, "name":{"label":"dearreid"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-20T10:47:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4"}, "id":{"label":"13979023837"}, "title":{"label":"Deserves an extra star"}, "content":{"label":"This is my most-used app, and it keeps getting better. It’s the only podcast app where the search, listing and playlist features work (close to) the way my mind wants to organize them. If I had one wish, it would be for the “Queue” playlist to override an individual show’s settings to delete unplayed episodes. If it’s in my Queue I put it there to listen to… eventually. :)\n\nThe Shortcuts support is second-to-none, and I’ve mapped the action button on my Apple Watch to play my “Sleep” podcasts for 30 minute with one click when I wake up in the middle of the night. \n\nAnd I love the new transcriptions feature! Such a help for those podcasts that keep poor show notes (I’m looking at you, The Ringer).\n\nI happily pay for the premium subscription, and would rate it 6 stars if I could.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id106002496"}, "name":{"label":"Evilkow"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-18T09:17:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4"}, "id":{"label":"13971601485"}, "title":{"label":"Literally the best podcast app"}, "content":{"label":"Sure, I’ve been listening to Marco on his podcasts for many years now. However, I don’t have any particular loyalty to using his app if it doesn’t suit my needs. I’ve tried out all of the other podcast apps out there worth trying, and Overcast is by far the best one out there, and it keeps getting better. Recently, he released an update featuring transcripts. It’s incredibly useful. I’ve subscribed to Overcast since it came out, and I’ll continue to subscribe to it. It’s simply the best podcast app out there.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
